+## Sites
+
+- `sites` lists the kitchens (`id`, `name`). Every location has a `site`,
+  and whatever is kept in a location belongs to that site: batches (and so
+  their movements), stock-takes and temperature readings. A record whose
+  location is not listed counts for site `main`.
